    "Bonjour coach ! Je viens de connecter mon app Coach. Commence par get_athlete_overview, pose-moi les questions dont tu as besoin (objectif, disponibilités, blessures), puis construis mon programme avec upsert_sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi coach! I just connected my Coach app. Start with get_athlete_overview, ask me what you need to know (goal, availability, injuries), then build my plan with upsert_sessions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
